{
  "name": "Weekly Shopify Store Price Drop & Sale Monitor (Apify -> Google Sheets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shopify Price Drop & Sale Monitor (Apify -> Google Sheets)\n\nAutomatically scans Shopify competitor stores every Monday, filters for in-stock products currently marked on sale (`onSale === true`), computes each item's `discountPct`, and upserts clean deal rows into Google Sheets.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n- Set `APIFY_TOKEN` in n8n Environment Variables (Apify's free $5/month credit covers testing).\n- Connect a Google Sheets OAuth2 credential and replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 450,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Overview & Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [140, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Schedule & Shopify Stores\n\nEdit **Configure Shopify Stores** to track any public Shopify domains (for example `allbirds.com`, `gymshark.com`) and raise `maxProducts` as needed.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-config",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 1 Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 560]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Scrape & Filter Markdowns\n\nCalls **67-labs/shopify-store-products-scraper** on Apify, keeps only `product` records that are both `onSale` and `inStock`, and deduplicates by `productId`.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-extract",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 2 Scrape & Filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 3: Compute Discount % & Sync\n\nCalculates `discountPct` from `compareAtPrice` vs `price` and upserts each item into Google Sheets matched by `productId`.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-sheets",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 3 Score & Sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1280, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [1],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-weekly",
      "name": "Weekly Monday Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [200, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "Manual Test Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-stores",
              "name": "stores",
              "value": "={{ [\"allbirds.com\", \"gymshark.com\"] }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-max",
              "name": "maxProducts",
              "value": 100,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "configure-stores",
      "name": "Configure Shopify Stores",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [440, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/67-labs~shopify-store-products-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{ $env.APIFY_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ stores: $json.stores, maxProducts: $json.maxProducts, includeCollections: false }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-shopify",
      "name": "Scrape Shopify Store Products (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [700, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-record-type",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.recordType || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "product",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-on-sale",
              "leftValue": "={{ Boolean($json.onSale) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-in-stock",
              "leftValue": "={{ Boolean($json.inStock) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-sale",
      "name": "Filter In-Stock Sale Products",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [940, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeDuplicateInputItems",
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": {
          "fields": [
            {
              "fieldName": "productId"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dedupe-product",
      "name": "Deduplicate by Product ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1160, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "out-id",
              "name": "productId",
              "value": "={{ $json.productId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-store",
              "name": "store",
              "value": "={{ $json.store || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-title",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.title || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-vendor",
              "name": "vendor",
              "value": "={{ $json.vendor || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-type",
              "name": "productType",
              "value": "={{ $json.productType || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-currency",
              "name": "currency",
              "value": "={{ $json.currency || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-price",
              "name": "price",
              "value": "={{ $json.price ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-compare",
              "name": "compareAtPrice",
              "value": "={{ $json.compareAtPrice ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-discount",
              "name": "discountPct",
              "value": "={{ ($json.compareAtPrice && $json.price && $json.compareAtPrice > $json.price) ? Math.round((($json.compareAtPrice - $json.price) / $json.compareAtPrice) * 100) : 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-variants",
              "name": "variantCount",
              "value": "={{ $json.variantCount ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-url",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.url || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-image",
              "name": "imageUrl",
              "value": "={{ $json.imageUrl || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-updated",
              "name": "updatedAt",
              "value": "={{ $json.updatedAt || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-scraped",
              "name": "scrapedAt",
              "value": "={{ $json.scrapedAt || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-deal",
      "name": "Format Price Drop Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1380, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": ["productId"]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert Deals to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1600, 320]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Weekly Monday Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Configure Shopify Stores",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Manual Test Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Configure Shopify Stores",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Configure Shopify Stores": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Scrape Shopify Store Products (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Scrape Shopify Store Products (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter In-Stock Sale Products",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter In-Stock Sale Products": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Deduplicate by Product ID",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Deduplicate by Product ID": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Price Drop Row",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Price Drop Row": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert Deals to Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
